@startuml

hide footbox

title US008 - To register a new city in the system

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

'Human Interactions between Administrator and System
Administrator -> System : **1** I want to register a new city in the system!
activate System
System --> Administrator : **2** From which country is the city?
deactivate System
Administrator -> System : **3** The city is from the country <countryName>
activate System
System --> Administrator : **4** What is the name of the city?
deactivate System
Administrator -> System : **5** The city's name is <cityName>!
activate System
System --> Administrator : **6** <cityName> has been registered successfully!
deactivate System
@enduml